{"sourceUrl":"https://europe.bfsu.edu.cn/info/1101/4905.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:39.616771+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://europe.bfsu.edu.cn/info/1101/4905.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<h3><strong><span><span>北京外国语大学欧洲语言文化学院</span></span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><span>接收2026</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年推荐免试研究生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（含直博生）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>工作方案</span></span></strong><br/></h3><p><span><span>根据研究生院《北京外国语大学关于接收</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读</span></span><span><span>研究生（含直博生）</span></span><span><span>工作办法》等文件细则，结合我院特点，坚持公平、公正、公开和科学选拔的原则，坚持德智体</span></span><span><span>美劳</span></span><span><span>全面衡量、择优</span></span><span><span>推荐</span></span><span><span>的原则，制定</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生工作方案</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span>采用线下考核的</span><span><span>方式，依次为笔试和面试。笔试满分</span><span>100分，时间2小时。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核时间</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>考核日期为</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日（周</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>），</span></span><strong><span><span>笔试时间为</span><span>9:</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>0-11:</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>0；面试时间为14:00-18:00</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>工作程序</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（一）申请基本条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>考生须为</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生，且获得本科所在高校</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推免生的推荐。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>优先考虑在本科阶段有公开发表的本专业学术论文、科研成果或在全国重大专业竞赛中获奖的申请人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>申请人需满足各学院制定的其他条件。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）考生报考</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1．我校各专业报考要求：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）外语类</span></span><span><span>专业一般情况下只</span></span><span><span>接收本科是相应语种专业的学生申请；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>非通用语种只接受本科是相应语种专业学生的申请。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．推免生考试的网上报名：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）报名网址：</span></span><span><span>北外研究生院网站</span><span>→</span></span><span><span>招生管理平台</span></span><span><span>→“</span></span><span><span>推免生报名</span></span><span><span>” </span></span><span><span>https://yjszs.bfsu.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>#/homeIndex</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>注册登录系统后，按要求填写报名表并上传相关附件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>报名开放时间详见各学院公告，</span></span><strong><span><span>截止时间为</span><span>9月10日17：00</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>资格审查</span></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>报名后，学院将根据接收推免生条件审核考生网报信息及考生提交到指定邮箱的</span><span>“资格审查文件”，进行推免考试资格评定。“资格审查文件”（扫描件）须在</span></span><strong><span><span>9月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>10</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>:00</span></span></strong><span><span>前发送到邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:wanghongyi@bfsu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>w</span></span><span><span>angweifang61</span></span><span><span>@bfsu.edu.cn</span></span></a><span> <span>。审核通过的准考名单将于</span></span><strong><span><span>9月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>11</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>:00</span></span></strong><span><span>前在欧洲语言文化学院官网</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>https://europe.bfsu.edu.cn/）</span></span><span><span>公布。请考生保持密切关注。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人在我校推免生网报系统填报的个人基本信息，包括</span><span>“</span></span><strong><span><span>推免排名（申请人在本科就读高校同年级所有该专业的学生总人数中的排名）</span></span></strong><span><span>”等，须与资格审查时提交的证明材料一致，也须与9月底本科学校向教育部的中国研招网推免生服务系统上报的信息一致，否则为信息造假，等同于作弊，一经查实，取消推免考试资格或拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>资格审查文件包括：</span></span></strong><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>有效期内的身份证原件</span></span><span><span>。</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>每学期均注册的学生证原件</span></span><span><span>。</span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>本科学习成绩单原件一份（</span></span><strong><span><span>加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院公章</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>获得本科所在学校推免生资格及专业排名的证明原件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>  <span>（四）复试安排</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>笔试</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>考生资格审核时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>15</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>8</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>:</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>0-</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9:3</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><span><span>。考生应携带上述</span><span>“资格审查文件”原件到北京外国语大学国际大厦347教室</span></span><span><span>进行准考资格复核。</span></span><strong><span><span>未参加考前资格复核者，考试成绩无效</span></span></strong><span><span>。【考生可凭身份证原件</span><span>+准考证原件从北外西校区东门入校】</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>笔试考试地点将在公布准考名单时一并公布</span></span></strong><span><span>，考生须提前十分钟到达笔试考场。考试试题和考试答题纸将在笔试开考前五分钟发放。考生须在答题纸上填写考生姓名、学号等必要信息。</span></span><span><span>答题纸单面作答，密封线内不得作答</span></span><span><span>。考试时间到，所有考生务必立即停止作答，等待监考老师收卷确认后，方可离开考场。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>.面试</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>考生在下午面试开始前</span><span>20分钟内进入候考考场（</span></span><strong><span><span>将在公布准考名单时一并公布地点</span></span></strong><span><span>），听从候考室考务老师安排。面试次序由现场随即抽签决定。候考期间无故不得离开候考考场，前面考生面试结束后须立即离开主楼，不得逗留，更不得将面试试题以各种方式透露给待考考生，一经发现将视以作弊行为论处。候考期间，会有候考老师逐一叫号并带领考生进入面试考场，</span></span><span><span>每位考生面试时间不少于</span><span>20分钟</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>主考老师宣布考试结束后，考生方可离开考场。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、考试办法</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>按照考生总成绩排序，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>未参加笔试、面试或未通过资格审查的考生一律不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>总成绩</span><span>=笔试</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>×50%+面试</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>×50%</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>录取原则：考生的总成绩或笔试、面试成绩低于</span><span>60分者，确定为成绩不合格，不予录取。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>接收录取</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>申请人须登录</span><span>“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“中国研招网推免生系统”，网址：http//yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）进行注册，填写报考学校、专业志愿等。考生在接收待录取通知后，须在规定时间内通过“中国研招网推免生系统”确认接受，方视为完成拟录取手续，否则视为放弃。</span></span></p><p><span><span>拟录取推免生入学前如有下列问题之一者将被取消入学资格：未能获得本科毕业证书；有弄虚作假、徇私舞弊行为并被查实者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院招生咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>010-</span></span><span><span>8881</span></span><span><span>8672</span></span></p><p><span><span>北京外国语大学研究生招生办公室：</span></span><span><span>010-88816246</span></span><span><span>/7925</span></span></p><p><span><span>北京外国语大学纪委办公室：</span><span>010-88816259</span></span></p><p><span><span>北京教育考试院研招办招生专用监督电话：</span><span>010-82837456</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>北京外国语大学欧洲语言文化学院办公室</span></span></p><p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div><div></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"229a45ac060799a6d69f7b624c82a7205cbec7449fbd1f89df3e608db56d713c","textLength":2010,"sourceSha256":"1b27a5db3aaf698c6f7c0d9c9fab3df40001276a6b611d8bee34904c5629b96c","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e61729f9bacd64d76aed","title":"2025年北京外国语大学欧洲语言文化学院接收2026年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:39.616771+00:00"}
